---
title: Squire Architecture - host-alpha design baseline
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph EXT["EXTERNAL"]
        AN["Anthropic<br/>Fable 5 / Sonnet 4.6"]
        TV["Tavily<br/>search enrichment"]
        TG["Telegram<br/>operator bot"]
        N8C["n8n webhook<br/>consumers"]
    end

    subgraph CF["CLOUDFLARE EDGE"]
        TUN["cloudflare-tunnel<br/>WAF + 100 rpm rate limit"]
        R1["squire.example-ops.com"]
        R2["n8n.example-ops.com"]
        R3["langfuse.example-ops.com"]
    end

    subgraph HOST["host-alpha instance - /opt/platform"]
        subgraph SQ["Squire stack"]
            SVC["svc-squire<br/>FastAPI + LangGraph"]
            NM["svc-nemo<br/>Guardrails sidecar"]
        end

        subgraph LF["Langfuse stack"]
            LW["svc-langfuse-web"]
            LK["svc-langfuse-worker"]
            LC["svc-langfuse-clickhouse"]
            LR["svc-langfuse-redis"]
        end

        subgraph CORE["Core platform"]
            DB["svc-db<br/>Postgres + pgvector"]
            N8["svc-n8n<br/>SOAR orchestration"]
            OL["svc-ollama<br/>local LLM"]
            VA["svc-vault<br/>HashiCorp Vault"]
            KC["svc-keycloak<br/>SSO + MFA"]
            TP["svc-teleport<br/>PAM + JIT"]
        end

        subgraph OBS["Observability + detection"]
            DD["svc-datadog"]
            FK["svc-falco<br/>eBPF detection"]
        end

        subgraph GW["Gateway"]
            OC["openclaw-gateway<br/>Claude Fable 5 agent"]
        end
    end

    TUN --> R1
    TUN --> R2
    TUN --> R3

    R1 -->|auth header| SVC
    R2 --> N8
    R3 --> LW

    SVC --> NM
    SVC --> DB
    SVC --> LW
    SVC --> LK
    SVC -.->|Fable 5 draft/critique,<br/>Sonnet 4.6 classify| AN
    SVC -.->|enrichment| TV

    N8 -->|alert dispatch| SVC
    SVC -.->|recommend-only<br/>via n8n route| TG
    N8 --> N8C

    LW --> LC
    LK --> LC
    LW --> LR
    LK --> LR

    DD -.->|metrics + logs| FK
    DD -.->|metrics| SVC
    DD -.->|metrics| N8

